# Title: Database Standards
# Applies: Data, Migrations, Models

PRIMARY KEYS
- {entity}_id as UUID (e.g., sessions.session_id, leads.lead_id)

FOREIGN KEYS
- Use {referenced_entity}_id naming

TIMESTAMPS
- *_at suffixes: created_at, updated_at, started_at

BOOLEANS
- is_* prefix: is_active, is_connected, is_qualified
